---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Teaching · Phongsakon Mark Konrad" description="Teaching, mentoring, and service.">
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Teaching</h1>
      <p class="section-sub">Courses, supervision, and academic service.</p>

      <div class="teach-card">
        <h3><a href="https://odin.sdu.dk/sitecore/index.php?a=fagbesk&id=203753&lang=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Artificial Intelligence (T200042101)</a></h3>
        <div class="when">Teaching Assistant · BSc Engineering, University of Southern Denmark · Jan 2026 – Jun 2026</div>
        <p>Lab sessions and project supervision for the AI course in the Software Engineering programme. Search, knowledge representation, planning, classical ML, neural nets, evaluation.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:.4rem"><a href="https://phomarkon.github.io/ai101/#/welcome" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Course materials I built for the students ↗</a></p>
      </div>

      <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem">Invited Talks</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Talks to industry and the wider community.</p>

      <div class="teach-card">
        <h3>Agentic Engineering in Practice</h3>
        <div class="when">House of Software Sønderborg · Feb 2026</div>
        <p>Invited to speak at the community's inaugural event, introducing agent skills, the Model Context Protocol, and plugin-based development to an audience of 100+ software engineers, engineering leaders, and founders.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem">Academic Service</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Lab affiliations and committee work.</p>

      <div class="teach-card">
        <h3>Research Collaborator, DataVISards group, HKUST</h3>
        <div class="when">Jan 2026 – present</div>
      </div>
      <div class="teach-card">
        <h3>Research Collaborator, Data &amp; Intelligence Lab, SDU</h3>
        <div class="when">Jan 2026 – present</div>
      </div>
      <div class="teach-card">
        <h3>Research Assistant, Data &amp; Intelligence Lab, SDU</h3>
        <div class="when">Sep 2024 – Dec 2025</div>
      </div>
      <div class="teach-card">
        <h3>Student Member, Educational Committee, Software Engineering Programme</h3>
        <div class="when">Jun 2025 – present · University of Southern Denmark</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
